  "notes": [
    "Role names present in code: operations, manager, personnel. No explicit 'user' role is defined in DB; here 'user' denotes any logged-in user without a specific role.",
    "Guest accounts are represented by an empty user via Authsome::login('guest'), but AppController.beforeFilter enforces a session redirect for most actions (except People.upload).",
    "'schedule_owner' condition derives from AppController.beforeFilter: Schedule.editable is true when current user (Authsome::get('id')) equals Session('Schedule.user_id') AND user has 'operations' role.",
    "'request_mode' condition derives from AppController.redirectIfNotEditable: access allowed when Session('Schedule.request') == 2 regardless of role.",
    "'manager_of_area' condition derives from AppController.redirectIfNotManager: user must manage the area id passed in to the action.",
    "config/acl.ini.php contains CakePHP example placeholders only and no active per-controller ACL rules.",
    "Operations-only checks are marked as allowed_roles: ['UNKNOWN'] because 'operations' is not one of the requested roles [manager, personnel, user, guest]."
  ]
